<title>SOUTH KOREA: Daewoo Electronics final 1996 net rises.</title>
<headline>Daewoo Electronics final 1996 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>							1996	  1995</p>
<p>    Shr (won)					630    vs   611</p>
<p>    Net						 48.46 vs    47.23</p>
<p>    Dividend (pct, par 5,000 won)		7    vs     7</p>
<p>    Turnover				     3,570.16 vs 3,126.00</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			     60.06 vs    60.37</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries (both loss)		  7.92 vs    21.61</p>
<p>NOTE - Daewoo Electronics Co is a unit of the Daewoo Group electronics makers. It had a share capital totalling 78.31 million shares at the end of 1996, unchanged from 1995.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5646</p>
</text>
